   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "<p dir=\"ltr\">The scatter plot below shows the results of a survey of eighth-grade students who were asked to report the number of hours per week they spend playing video games and the typical number of hours they sleep each night.</p>\n<br><br> <p dir=\"ltr\"><img alt=\"A SCATTER PLOT THAT SHOWS VIDEO GAME TIME IN HOURS PER WEEK ON THE X-AXIS AND SLEEP TIME IN HOURS PER NIGHT ON THE Y-AXIS. THE LINE DRAWN DECREASES FROM LEFT TO RIGHT.\" height=\"409\" src=\"exercises/media/1e1afbbd5928c4e7.jpg\" width=\"450\"></p>\n<br> <p dir=\"ltr\">Which of the following conclusions can you make looking at the data?</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1222490,
     "content_html": "There is not a trend between time spent on video games and sleep time."
    },
    {
     "id": 1222491,
     "content_html": "As video game time increases, sleep time decreases."
    },
    {
     "id": 1222489,
     "content_html": "As video game time decreases, sleep time decreases."
